        "raw": "<p>My brother and I were playing a game the other night against Citizen Dawn, and Citizen Autumn was in play. &nbsp;Citizen Autumn, of course, destroys all ongoing cards of the hero with the lowest hp. &nbsp;At one point Bunker and Fanatic were tied with the lowest hp. &nbsp;Bunker had one ongoing card in play, and Fanatic didn&#39;t have any in play. &nbsp;We chose to have Citizen Autumn target Fanatic since she didn&#39;t have any cards in play thus protecting Bunker&#39;s card. &nbsp;Did we play this right? &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I think the main confusion comes from the wording on Citizen Autumn&#39;s card. &nbsp;The wording makes it seem as if only one hero is targeted. &nbsp;However, I&#39;m not sure this is the case if two or more heroes have the lowest hp. &nbsp;So, a second question, If two or more heroes have the lowest hp does Citizen Dawn target all of them?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks for the help.</p>",
