        "created_at": "2013-07-30T19:27:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The rulebook states the following on page 8:</p><p>\n&gt; </p><p>Addiotnally, there are time when playrs may encounter ambiguous situations, such as tied HP. in any ambiguous sistuation, the players choose the outcome.</p><p>example: Baron Blade plays \"slash and burn\", dealing the hero with teh lowest HP 4 melee damage and the hero with the highest 6 fire damage. Absolute Zero and the Visionary are currently tied for the highest HP at 23 HP each. fter brief consideration, the players decide that the 6 fire damage should be dealt to Absolute Zero.</p><p>\n</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So yes, you played it right.</p>",
